The point of this project is to create an ADS-B validator system, flood defense, and replay attack defense. You will see all the necessary files needed to run each attack in this repo.

terminal 1:
cd dump1090
./dump1090 --net --write-json public_html/data --fix

terminal 2:
cd dump1090/public_html
python3 -m http.server 8080

terminal 3:
python3 adsb_final_attack.py --dump1090 http://localhost:8080/data/aircraft.json --attack all --duration 60

terminal 4:
python3 adsb_final_attack.py --dump1090 http://localhost:8080/data/aircraft.json --attack all --duration 60 | python3 adsb_final_defense.py
